  "final_message": "The [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w2/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L37) event has been updated to align field naming with the Payments and Customer APIs while complying with **ARCH-4** (additive schema evolution and deprecation to avoid breaking external consumers like `billing-service` and `analytics-ingest`):\n\n- Added `createdAt` (equal to `order.placedAt`) and marked `placedAt` as `@deprecated`.\n- Added `amountCents` (equal to `totalCents(order)`) and marked `totalCents` as `@deprecated`.\n- Updated [`orderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w2/r/src/core/events.ts#L52-L73) to emit both the new and deprecated fields.\n- Updated test expectations in [app.test.ts](file:///C:/avg/w2/r/test/app.test.ts) and [adapters.test.ts](file:///C:/avg/w2/r/test/adapters.test.ts).\n",
